# Into a mission: past the logo and intro, name entry, main menu, garage,
# mission select, sortie. Ends on the first mission chatter.
#
# The first recording ever to reach a mission -- M2's gate names this file.
# What it shows: the 3D scene is drawn (a million textured draws, twenty
# billion textured pixels) and the screen is flat white anyway; see findings
# item 32 for what is on top of it.
#
# Recorded by Sif, 2 Sep, 108 seconds of play, 1,751 polls. The `stop` is
# what keeps a replay to that: without it the run carried on for 70,000
# polls drawing white frames until the drain expired, thirty minutes for
# a question the first forty-five seconds had answered.
#
#   scripts/09-replay.sh --decode --env PSPRECOMP_FRAME=reports/mission.ppm \
#                        scenarios/mission-1.pad

drain 180

@76     state circle 128 128   # t=3.080s
